                <pb facs="0843" n="753" sameAs="frus:frus1920v02/pg753"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.00/479b: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McMillin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-05-24T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1920—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>50. Department desires immediate report on present situation, including your
                    opinion as to whether life of Estrada Cabrera is in immediate danger.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
